msgid "Events can be used in timelines and do all kinds of things. They often interact with subsystems and dialogic nodes."
msgstr "事件可在时间轴中使用，能实现各种效果。它们通常与子系统和 Dialogic 节点交互。"

msgid "Subsystems hold specialized functionality. They mostly manage communication between events and dialogic nodes. Often they provide handy methods that can be accessed by the user like this: Dialogic.Subsystem.a_method()."
msgstr "子系统承载专门的功能，主要负责事件与 Dialogic 节点之间的通信。它们往往提供便捷方法，可以这样调用：Dialogic.Subsystem.a_method()。"

msgid "Text effects can be used in text events. They will be executed once reached and can take a single argument."
msgstr "文本效果可用于文本事件，播放到时会执行一次，并且可以接受一个参数。"

msgid "Modifiers can modify text from text events before it is shown."
msgstr "修饰符可在文本显示前修改文本事件的内容。"

msgid "Style presets can be activated and modified in the Styles editor. They provide the design of the dialog interface in your game."
msgstr "样式预设可在\"样式\"编辑器中启用和修改。它们决定游戏中对话框界面的外观。"

msgid "Editors provide a user interface for editing dialogic data."
